      "text": {
        "hi": "नियम: व्यंजन + y → ies (pony → ponies), स्वर + y → s (monkey → monkeys), f/fe → ves (leaf → leaves, knife → knives)। कुछ ख़ास: ox → oxen, mouse → mice, deer → deer।",
        "hinglish": "Niyam: vyanjan + y → ies (pony → ponies), swar + y → s (monkey → monkeys), f/fe → ves (leaf → leaves, knife → knives). Kuchh khaas: ox → oxen, mouse → mice, deer → deer.",
        "en": "Rules: consonant + y → ies (pony → ponies), vowel + y → s (monkey → monkeys), f/fe → ves (leaf → leaves, knife → knives). Special: ox → oxen, mouse → mice, deer → deer."
      }
    },
